Package: libxml-sanitize1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Description: XML sanitization library
 A XML sanitization library supporting multiple backends with
 comprehensive XML cleaning, entity escaping, tag filtering,
 and security sanitization features.
 .
 Features include:
  - Multiple backend support (custom, expat, libxml2, mxml, etc...)
  - Tag/attribute whitelisting
  - Entity escaping
  - Control character removal
  - UTF-8 validation
  - Custom filter callbacks
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

